    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19623" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰτίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, a flat fish, perh. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>skate</i> or <i>ray,</i>
